// PowerShell Set-Acl On Windows Folder - PsScript | T1222 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/powershell/powershell_script/posh_ps_set_acl_susp_location.yml
(powershell.file.script_block_text:*Set\-Acl\ * AND powershell.file.script_block_text:*\-AclObject\ *) AND (powershell.file.script_block_text:(*\-Path\ \"C\:\\Windows* OR *\-Path\ \"C\:\/Windows* OR *\-Path\ 'C\:\\Windows* OR *\-Path\ 'C\:\/Windows* OR *\-Path\ C\:\\Windows* OR *\-Path\ C\:\/Windows* OR *\-Path\ $env\:windir* OR *\-Path\ \"$env\:windir* OR *\-Path\ '$env\:windir*)) AND (powershell.file.script_block_text:(*FullControl* OR *Allow*))
